&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12s8via&quot; data-start=&quot;536&quot; data-end=&quot;666&quot;&gt;Ability to communicate effectively in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;576&quot; data-end=&quot;600&quot;&gt;French and/or German&lt;/strong&gt; is preferred to support collaboration with regional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
