&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Engineer, Network Services focus will be responsible for managing, supporting, and enhancing BlueCrest’s global network infrastructure, including data networks, telecommunications, network security, advanced IP services, and unified communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits within the Infrastructure Platform team and offers opportunities to work across other core platforms, including Linux, Storage, Windows and Hypervisors. As a result, a broad range of experience and a strong understanding of how wider technology infrastructure platforms integrate and co-exist would be beneficial. In particular, solid Unix operating system knowledge and operational experience would be an advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additionally, we are looking for engineers who bring the experience and mindset needed to help us adopt modern technology practices, including Infrastructure as Code, AI-enabled operations, automation-led delivery, and SRE practices. As we continue to grow our hybrid networking capabilities across on-premise/colocation, Azure and AWS, we are seeking expertise in designing, building, and supporting robust, deterministic cloud network environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor, support, and maintain BlueCrest’s global networks and related systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out BAU changes across all network systems in line with the change control process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build network products for on-premises data centres, colocation trading, offices, WAN, and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for network security area, with experience operating and maintaining next-generation firewall platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain network systems and associated code, following Infrastructure as Code and SRE practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver project work across all networking disciplines and wider infrastructure platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the architecture and roadmap for BlueCrest’s networks and platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain data centre and communications room environments, including racking and patching network equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage third-party vendors, data centre providers, and telecoms providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and Skills required:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An experienced network engineer with a minimum of 5 years of experience working in a financial institution/ fast-paced environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of TCP/IP protocols and networking fundamentals, equivalent to CCNP level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Cisco hardware, switching, and routing experience across data centre and enterprise networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cisco ACI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cisco IOS-XE switches and routers
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cisco ACI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cisco IOS-XE switches and routers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with next-generation firewalls, particularly Palo Alto platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BAU changes: Policies, NAT, Routing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring: analyse firewall logs with next gen features
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BAU changes: Policies, NAT, Routing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring: analyse firewall logs using next-generation firewall features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with fundamental Unix operating system knowledge, skills, and working experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Azure and AWS cloud networking experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure as Code and SRE for Network skills including using API, Programming, Scripting and Orchestration skills
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python, Ansible and Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rest APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in office infrastructure design, build and migration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Datacentre physical and logical migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network performance monitoring and packet capture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in support VoIP technologies.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avaya Enterprise Call Managers or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
